# The Horde rank 11 PvP mounts from Raider Bork in Orgrimmar.
# Rank 11 (Commander / Lieutenant General) unlocks the Black War mounts;
# vendors in Stormwind and Orgrimmar.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70532 via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level 40,
# 100g, no rank in the item itself; MountCapability: each needs Riding 150 and
# its kind's riding: Wolf Riding, Raptor Riding, Kodo Riding, Undead
# Horsemanship; CurrencyTypes: Rank Points come from battlegrounds and tasks
# given in Gadgetzan). Blizzard's PvP article (October 2026): Rank Points from
# battlegrounds, PvP quests and the season's weekly tasks, a weekly cap, rank 11
# Mounts, and the Player vs. Player tab of the character pane.
# Raider Bork's place: Forever's world data spawn (build 70170), in the open
# city now rather than an instanced hall.
# ASSUMED: they cost 100g (client price); beta player guides say PvP rewards are
# bought with Honor. In-game check: Raider Bork's price.

step PvP rank 11
  tip Rank Points come from battlegrounds, PvP quests and the season's weekly tasks, with a weekly cap; Lieutenant General (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. The Player vs. Player tab of your character pane shows your rank and what you may buy. Riding one at full speed needs Journeyman Riding (level 60). Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 60 and Journeyman Riding.
  level 60
  skill Riding 150

step Raider Bork
  tip Raider Bork sells the mounts by the Hall of Legends in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, beside the other honor quartermasters. The Forever client lists each at 100g. Each one also needs its kind's riding: Orcs ride the wolf, Trolls the raptor, Tauren the kodo, Undead the skeletal warhorse. A Skyborne, or anyone choosing another race's mount, first needs that riding from its trainer (Exalted with the race's city).
  vendor 12796 @37.9,64.2             -- Raider Bork
  buy 18245 npc 12796 @37.9,64.2 optional -- Black War Wolf, Wolf Riding, 100g
  buy 18246 npc 12796 @37.9,64.2 optional -- Black War Raptor, Raptor Riding, 100g
  buy 18247 npc 12796 @37.9,64.2 optional -- Black War Kodo, Kodo Riding, 100g
  buy 18248 npc 12796 @37.9,64.2 optional -- Red Skeletal Warhorse, Undead Horsemanship, 100g
